    "citation": "Foa EB, Huppert JD, Leiberg S, Langner R, Kichic R, Hajcak G, Salkovskis PM (2002). The Obsessive-Compulsive Inventory: development and validation of a short version. Psychol Assess, 14(4), 485-496.",
